      "title": "Simply Extraordinary - Amazing Experience",
      "text": "Refugio is a forest where Peruvian gastronomy is born and enchants you with everything it offers. The area for children and its services is amazing. The shows are phenomenal, the food is worth repeating every day since you have many options. The best of all is that you always have somewhere to sit. Simply spectacular.\nRefugio is a jungle where Peruvian Gastronomic was born and bewiches you with everything it has. The children place and facilities are amazing. The music shows are spectacular, the food it's to repeat every day. Finally it's wonderfull when you have seat always.",
